        "question": "What is the proposed solution about INVOLVE?",
        "answer": "The proposed solution, INVOLVE, is an AI-powered on-demand local services platform designed to provide fast, reliable, and intelligent service delivery for emergency situations. \n\nKey aspects of the solution include:\n\n*   **AI-Based Issue Diagnosis:** The platform uses user descriptions, images, and voice input to analyze and identify problems, estimate their severity, and classify requests into appropriate service categories.\n*   **Intelligent Worker Assignment:** Instead of relying solely on proximity, the system uses an AI engine to assign the most suitable verified professional based on multiple parameters, including worker expertise, availability, emergency severity, ratings, and historical performance.\n*   **Enhanced Transparency and Security:** The platform features real-time GPS tracking, ETA prediction, dynamic pricing, and blockchain-secured payments to improve user trust.\n*   **Response Time:** The system aims to ensure a guaranteed 10-minute response time for emergency requests.\n*   **Improved Efficiency:** By providing professionals with better information before they arrive, the platform aims to reduce service delays, operational costs, and the need for repeated visits.",
