        "question": "What is INVOLVE an AI powered on demand local service platform, what is its problem statement, objective and proposed solution?",
        "answer": "Based on the provided text, here is the information regarding INVOLVE:\n\n**What is INVOLVE?**\nINVOLVE is an AI-powered on-demand local services platform designed to bridge the gap in existing services by providing fast, reliable, and intelligent service delivery. It integrates Artificial Intelligence, cloud computing, real-time communication, geolocation services, and blockchain technology to create a unified platform aimed at improving response time, service quality, and operational efficiency.\n\n**Problem Statement**\nExisting local service platforms focus primarily on scheduled bookings and often fail to provide rapid responses for emergencies like vehicle breakdowns, electrical faults, plumbing leaks, appliance failures, and urgent home maintenance. These systems suffer from:\n*   Long waiting times and difficulty finding qualified professionals.\n*   Lack of transparent pricing and limited real-time tracking.\n*   Inefficient communication.\n*   Assignment of workers based only on proximity or availability, without considering expertise, workload, emergency severity, or historical performance.\n*   The absence of AI-based issue diagnosis, which leads to incorrect service allocation, repeated visits, and delayed problem resolution.\n\n**Objective**\nThe objective of INVOLVE is to address the shortcomings of existing local service platforms\u2014such as inefficient worker allocation and long waiting times\u2014by providing a scalable, intelligent, and reliable solution that meets the demand for rapid emergency assistance. It aims to ensure a guaranteed 10-minute response time for emergency requests.\n\n**Proposed Solution**\nThe platform utilizes an AI engine to analyze user-provided text, images, or voice input to identify problems and estimate their severity. Instead of simply selecting the nearest professional, the system intelligently assigns the most suitable verified worker based on:\n*   Emergency level.\n*   Worker expertise, availability, proximity, ratings, and historical performance.\n\nAdditionally, the platform enhances transparency, security, and user trust through features such as real-time GPS tracking, ETA prediction, dynamic pricing, and blockchain-secured payments.",
        "timestamp": "2026-08-13T19:41:18.346354"
    },
